1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,264
The ANC Hub now keeps navigation in one short
row.

2
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:08,679
Resources, Pages, Timeline, Slack, and
Activity each have a clear home.

3
00:00:08,679 --> 00:00:12,693
The growing row of document tabs has moved
into Pages.

4
00:00:12,693 --> 00:00:16,707
Your account still shows only the
destinations your permissions allow.

5
00:00:17,407 --> 00:00:20,375
Choose Pages to find guides, reports, and
shared work.

6
00:00:20,375 --> 00:00:24,661
You can read the full title, search by name
or topic, and check

7
00:00:24,661 --> 00:00:27,629
whether a page is published or still a draft.

8
00:00:27,629 --> 00:00:31,916
Admins also have draft and archive filters,
plus Blank page and Create with

9
00:00:31,916 --> 00:00:32,246
AI.

10
00:00:32,246 --> 00:00:36,532
Open a row to read the page, then use All
pages to return

11
00:00:36,532 --> 00:00:37,521
to the library.

12
00:00:38,221 --> 00:00:41,719
Find anything opens search across your pages,
resources, and tools.

13
00:00:41,719 --> 00:00:46,266
You can also press Command K on a Mac, or
Control K on

14
00:00:46,266 --> 00:00:46,616
Windows.

15
00:00:46,616 --> 00:00:51,163
Type what you need, use the arrow keys to
choose a result, and

16
00:00:51,163 --> 00:00:52,912
press Enter to open it.

17
00:00:52,912 --> 00:00:53,961
Escape closes search.

18
00:00:53,961 --> 00:00:58,159
The results follow your access, so searching
does not reveal someone else's

19
00:00:58,159 --> 00:00:58,858
private pages.

20
00:00:59,558 --> 00:01:02,633
The sidebar now groups tools around the work.

21
00:01:02,633 --> 00:01:04,554
Intake brings together incoming requests.

22
00:01:04,554 --> 00:01:08,397
Build and estimate contains the tools for
preparing project outputs.

23
00:01:08,397 --> 00:01:11,472
Operations holds the supporting tools and
reference data.

24
00:01:11,472 --> 00:01:15,699
Expand the group you need; the current tool's
group opens automatically.

25
00:01:15,699 --> 00:01:19,542
Collapse the full sidebar when you need more
working space.

26
00:01:20,242 --> 00:01:23,652
On your phone, the menu button opens the same
navigation.

27
00:01:23,652 --> 00:01:28,085
Expand a group, open a tool, or use search to
jump straight to

28
00:01:28,085 --> 00:01:28,767
a page.

29
00:01:28,767 --> 00:01:33,200
The five Hub sections fit across the screen
without a scrolling document strip.

30
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:37,632
Start with Pages for a document, or Find
anything when you already know

31
00:01:37,632 --> 00:01:39,337
what you are looking for.
